      "faqs3": {
        "type": "faqs3",
        "blocks": {
          "062b25c7-eb10-42af-b9fd-d1f5cc3e2091": {
            "type": "collapsible_row",
            "settings": {
              "heading": "How long is the warranty on the SuperBrush?",
              "row_content": "<p>We’ve got you covered! Your SuperBrush comes with a warranty of 1 year, make sure you register your warranty within 30 days of buying your SuperBrush for it to be valid. </p>",
              "page": ""
            }
          },
          "09e6d5f7-e3b6-4578-b32c-796125472cfc": {
            "type": "collapsible_row",
            "settings": {
              "heading": "How to register?",
              "row_content": "<p>There’s a QR code on the inside of your box that you can scan to register your warranty. In case you missed it, register your warranty <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfqwEmhhLMxsp3z2Yi8jx_1IBzv_TygbBCCIpL_axE_Hnuggw/viewform?vc=0&c=0&w=1&flr=0\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfqwEmhhLMxsp3z2Yi8jx_1IBzv_TygbBCCIpL_axE_Hnuggw/viewform?vc=0&c=0&w=1&flr=0\">here</a>.</p>",
              "page": ""
            }
          },
          "7167ecea-63eb-4cb2-90d3-33dd9312cc0c": {
            "type": "collapsible_row",
            "settings": {
              "heading": "What does the warranty cover?",
              "row_content": "<p>The warranty covers defects arising from electro-magnetic parts and battery that impact functionality of the product. The warranty does not cover any damage due to improper usage and normal wear or use.</p>",
              "page": ""
            }
          },
          "c3c9da06-7a10-4c8c-80be-9655f7c047d1": {
            "type": "collapsible_row",
            "settings": {
              "heading": "My product isn’t working properly – help!",
              "row_content": "<p>While we hope this is very unlikely, even superheroes can have bad days. We have a team to assist you with any problems you may have, just <a href=\"mailto:wecare@sevenoralcare.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:wecare@sevenoralcare.com\">email us</a> or <a href=\"https://wa.me/919137986327\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wa.me/919137986327\">whatsapp us</a>. We promise to get back to you asap!</p>",
              "page": ""
            }
          }
        },
